* Three-phase diode bridge with source inductance and RC load
G1  sa sb sc 0  400 50
La  sa a  0.5m
Lb  sb b  0.5m
Lc  sc c  0.5m
D1  a p
D3  b p
D5  c p
D4  m a
D6  m b
D2  m c
Cd  p m 1m
Rd  p m 20
.tran 5u 100m start=60m
.window 40m
.plot V(p,m) I(La),I(Lb),I(Lc)
.measure mean V(p,m)
.measure pp V(p,m)
.measure thd I(La) 50 2
.end
